  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: yosys\n  version: \"0.70\"\n  sha256: c6bd8b83aad633f6786fc861fe8f5dbc74c37bfae77f7bd0220e6f00f15f1d55\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name|lower }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/YosysHQ/${{ name }}/releases/download/v${{ version }}/yosys.tar.gz\n  sha256: ${{ sha256 }}\n  patches:\n    # Import the conda Slang library for the SystemVerilog frontend and ABC's sn tool.\n    - system-slang.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip: win\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - if: linux\n      then:\n        - gcc\n        - gxx\n    - if: osx\n      then:\n        - clang\n        - clangxx\n    - bison\n    - cmake >=3.28\n    - make\n    - pkg-config\n    - python\n  host:\n    - flex\n    - fmt >=12.2\n    - libboost-devel\n    - libffi\n    - libzlib\n    - readline\n    - slang-verilog ==12.0\n    - mimalloc >=3.5\n    - tk\n    - tomlplusplus >=3.4\n    - zlib\n  run:\n    - graphviz\n    - libffi\n    - libzlib\n    - readline\n    - ${{ pin_compatible('slang-verilog', upper_bound='x') }}\n    - tk\n  ignore_run_exports:\n    by_name:\n      # Boost supplies headers; mimalloc is a dependency of slang-verilog.\n      - libboost\n      - libboost-headers\n      - libboost-devel\n      - mimalloc\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - yosys-config --prefix\n      - yosys-config --ldflags\n      - yosys -V\n      - yosys -p 'read_verilog smoke.v; synth -top smoke -noabc; abc -g AND,XOR; check -assert; select -assert-none t:$and t:$xor; select -assert-count 1 t:$_AND_; select -assert-count 1 t:$_XOR_'\n      - yosys -p 'read_slang smoke.v; prep -top smoke; check -assert; select -assert-count 1 t:$and; select -assert-count 1 t:$xor'\n      - sn -M smoke -o smoke.sn smoke.v\n      - test -s smoke.sn\n    files:\n      recipe:\n        - smoke.v\n\nabout:\n  license: ISC AND MIT AND BSD-2-Clause AND BSD-3-Clause AND Zlib AND bzip2-1.0.6 AND LicenseRef-ABC AND LicenseRef-Public-Domain\n  license_file:\n    - COPYING\n    - frontends/slang/lib/LICENSE\n    - libs/bigint/COPYING.txt\n    - libs/cxxopts/LICENSE\n    - libs/fst/LICENSE.txt\n    - libs/json11/LICENSE.txt\n    - libs/minisat/LICENSE\n    - libs/sha1/COPYING.txt\n    - libs/symfpu/LICENSE\n    - libs/symfpu/LICENSE-BSD\n    - abc/copyright.txt\n    - abc/tools/sn/copyright.txt\n    - abc/src/bdd/cudd/license\n    - abc/src/misc/btor/LICENSE.txt\n    - abc/src/misc/bzlib/LICENSE\n    - abc/src/misc/zlib/license\n    - abc/src/sat/bsat/license\n    - abc/src/sat/bsat2/LICENSE\n    - abc/src/sat/cadical/LICENSE\n    - abc/src/sat/glucose/license\n    - abc/src/sat/glucose2/license\n    - abc/src/sat/kissat/LICENSE\n    - abc/src/sat/satoko/LICENSE\n    - abc/src/sat/xsat/license\n  summary: Yosys Open SYnthesis Suite\n  description: |\n    This is a framework for RTL synthesis tools. It currently has extensive Verilog-2005 support and provides a basic set of synthesis algorithms for various application domains.\n  homepage: https://github.com/YosysHQ/yosys\n  repository: https://github.com/YosysHQ/yosys\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - whitequark\n    - timkpaine\n",
